.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-remote-aggregate-package 1  "geectl-remote-aggregate-package 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-aggregate\-package \- Aggregate a package\*(Aqs binaries into another package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the aggregation. The target package is created from the source package\*(Aqs meta when it does not exist yet; an `_aggregate` file that already exists is refused
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote aggregate\-package\fR [\fB\-\-repository\-map\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sources\fR] [\fB\-\-disable\-publish\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISOURCE_PROJECT\fR> <\fISOURCE_PACKAGE\fR> <\fITARGET_PROJECT\fR> <\fITARGET_PACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Aggregate a package\*(Aqs binaries into another package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the aggregation. The target package is created from the source package\*(Aqs meta when it does not exist yet; an `_aggregate` file that already exists is refused
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repository\-map\fR \fI<REPOSITORY_MAP>\fR
Map a source repository to a target repository, as `SOURCE=TARGET` (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sources\fR
Aggregate binaries only, not the sources
.TP
\fB\-\-disable\-publish\fR
Disable publishing of the aggregate package
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISOURCE_PROJECT\fR>
The project the source package lives in
.TP
<\fISOURCE_PACKAGE\fR>
The source package
.TP
<\fITARGET_PROJECT\fR>
The project the target package lives in
.TP
<\fITARGET_PACKAGE\fR>
The target package
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
